      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>As Steve pointed out in the thread, the %0 specifies the optional zone index.  Policies now do matching via wildcard, since the zone index can take several possible forms (not just %0, but %eth0, etc).</p>\n\n<p>References:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPv6_address#Link-local_addresses_and_zone_indices\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPv6_address#Link-local_addresses_and_zone_indices</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4007#section-6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4007#section-6</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3484#section-2.1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3484#section-2.1</a></p>",
     "created": "18/Feb/10 6:51 PM",
     "id": "11241",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10608/comment/11241",
